D(0, x)=1.x
D(0, y)=1.y
D(1, xy)=x.y
D(1, yy)=y.y+y.x+x.x
D(1, xx^2)=x.x^2
D(2, xyy)=xy.y+xy.x+xx^2.1
D(2, yyy)=yy.y+yy.x-xx^2.1
D(2, xx^2x)=xx^2.x
D(2, xx^2y)=xx^2.y
D(3, xyyy)=xyy.y+xyy.x-xx^2y.1-xx^2x.1
D(3, yyyy)=yyy.y+yyy.x+xx^2y.1+xx^2x.1
B(1,1)=2
B(2,2)=2
B(3,3)=1
B(3,4)=1
B(4,4)=1
